rkáris","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vendela","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Verdant","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vermeil","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vetochki","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigil","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigna","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vina Victoria","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Violet Mizutsune Orchid","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Virtuosa","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viviana","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulcan","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulpisfoglia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"W","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Waai Fu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wakaba Mutsumi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wang","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wanqing","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warfarin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warmy","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Weedy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":4,"rows":3,"opCell":[2,1],"rangeCells":[[1,1],[1,2],[1,3],[2,2],[2,3],[2,4],[3,1],[3,2],[3,3]]}},{"elite":1,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":4,"rows":3,"opCell":[2,1],"rangeCells":[[1,1],[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[2,2],[2,3],[2,4],[3,1],[3,2],[3,3],[3,4]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Did you call for me, Doctor? I feel so happy to be with you!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Doctor! Dr. Kal'tsit said that you need to look after your health more. In two words, E-A-T L-E-S-S! So there!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"You know, Doctor, if my sister starts getting all bossy with you, you have to tell me! She needs my treatment or else!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"Dr. Kal'tsit teaches me a ton of practical stuff, although it's tough to actually learn! At least I've always had a knack for nutrition, so I think I'm doing well with that!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"I feel better about everyone here, compared to when I just joined Rhodes Island! And they all eat my healthy food on schedule! But... why does everyone pull these weird faces when they finish?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"Tadaaaaaah! A special healthy meal just for you, Doctor! Decaf coffee and a hamburger without meat, cheese, pickles, or lettuce! Oh, and a mixed salad made of 12 different vegetables!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"Hey, Doctor, where does your family live? Are they doing well? I know there's things you can't tell them about because they're your family... but, still, I think you've got to reach out. You have to try, at least.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"Isn't it lonely cooking all by yourself? Let me help you out! Oh, right, and let's get Lava in here too!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Doctor, did you fall asleep? Have a good rest then. You need to sleep plenty to stay healthy.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"This is intern Hibiscus. From now on, I'll be in charge of managing yours and every Operator's health at Rhodes Island. Thank you for your cooperation!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"Oh, I see! So that's how you do it!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"It's my honor to be promoted! I'm looking forward to working under you for the health management of us all, Doctor!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"I won't fail you! I'll protect everyone!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Acknowledged! I'll take good care of everyone! First, I need to get my special sustained-release medicine ready...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Please take good care of yourself while I'm gone!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Ready to heal!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Don't be afraid!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Doctor?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"There we go.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"It's safe here!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Please come to your senses!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"I can heal that wound in no time!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Even if everyone gets wounded, I can heal them all with my staff!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"Looking after everyone's health is my greatest motivation.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Doctor! Everyone! Are you alright?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"No... First aid needed!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Anything I can help with?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Oh, my~!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Doctor, do you want to have a taste of my new vitamin drink?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Here, Doctor, your new customized healthy daily schedule! Relax, given this full table of gourmet food we have here, I will make an exception today. I will allow you — one bite of fries! That'll be my most generous offer!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Doctor! Would you mind tasting this?","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Stop hiding the cakes, Doctor. They aren't escaping my eyes!... Look at all these cakes you have here! It takes three full teaspoons of sugar to whip the cream for just one of them, let alone the milk and butter that went in there. I know, I understand they are just tokens of appreciation from your fellow operators. But you could have just looked at them — Hey, don't steal a bite when I'm talking!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"They had a celebration today? I was so occupied that I hardly noticed… Doesn't matter, as long as there are wounded looking for treatment, my job's not finished. Not to mention the goal I set for myself to become a better medic. See you then, Doctor, for I still got works to tend to!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Post-Promotion Talk 2","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2000,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Elite Promotion 2","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2001,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Yuuki Luna"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/58e999c42e9fb00832d571ab35a1666000557088/current/char_120_hibisc/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Yuka Iguchi"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/15ab8a81f1fc3b7e9b5486cf00c5afdc4b948649/current/char_120_hibisc/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["D. QQ"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/88535cc2a7c43056f2c370850184545b8c478a43/current/char_120_hibisc/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Bang Yeon-ji"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/38e75788058bbbbc5b17330a1591245fbb08f822/current/char_120_hibisc/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}